{
  "title": "Salawat upon Imam al-Kazim (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى الْاَمِيْنِ الْمُؤْتَمَنِ مُوْسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAL AMEENIL MU'TAMANI MOOSABNI JA'FAR\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon the honest and trusted Musa the son of Ja'far,\nالْبَرِّ الْوَفِيِّ الطَّاهِرِ الزَّكِيِّ\nAL-BARRIL WAFIYYIT TAAHIRIZ ZAKIYY\nthe dutiful, the faithful, the pure, the bright,\nالنُّوْرِ الْمُبِيْنِ الْمُجْتَهِدِ الْمُحْتَسِبِ\nAN-NOORIL MUBEENIL MUJTAHIDIL MUHTASIB\nthe clear light, the striver, the seeker of Your rewards,\nالصَّابِرِ عَلَى الْاَذٰى فِيْكَ\nAS-SAABIRI A'LAL ADHAA FEEK\nand the bearer of harm for Your sake.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَكَمَا بَلَّغَ عَنْ اٰبَاۤئِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA WA KAMAA BALLAGHA A'N AABAA'IH\nO Allah, as he conveyed on the authority of his fathers\nمَا اسْتُوْدِعَ مِنْ اَمْرِكَ وَنَهْيِكَ\nMAS TOODI'A MIN AMRIKA WA NAHYIK\nall Your orders and prohibitions that were deposited with him,\nوَحَمَلَ عَلَى الْمَحَجَّةِ\nWA HAMALA A'LAL MAHAJJAH\ndirected (people) to the clear course,\nوَكَابَدَ اَهْلَ الْعِزَّةِ وَالشِّدَّةِ\nWA KAABADA AHLAL I'ZZATI WASH SHIDDAH\nand had to encounter the people of authority and persecution\nفِيْمَا كَانَ يَلْقٰى مِنْ جُهَّالِ قَوْمِهٖ\nFEEMAA KAANA YALQAA MIN JUHHAALI QAWMIH\nwhile he was facing troubles from the ignorant people,\nرَبِّ فَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ اَفْضَلَ وَاَكْمَلَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلٰىۤ اَحَدٍ\nRABBI FASALLI A'LAYHI AFDALA WA AKMALA MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA AHAD\nso, O Lord, bless him with the most favorite and most perfect blessings that You have ever conferred upon any one\nمِمَّنْ اَطَاعَكَ وَنَصَحَ لِعِبَادِكَ\nMIMMAN ATAA'AKA WA NASAHA LI-I'BAADIK\nwho obeyed You and wished well for Your servants.\nاِنَّكَ غَفُوْرٌ رَحِيْمٌ\nINNAKA GHAFOORUR RAHEEM\nYou are verily All-forgiving, All-merciful.",
  "merits": "Within the recommended rites on Fridays, Shaykh al-Tusi, in his book of Misbah al-Mutahajjid, has mentioned the following invocation of blessings from Imam al-Hasan al-'Askari (a.s.)."
}
